  id: condition-charmed
  displayName: Charmed
  description: A charmed creature can't attack the charmer or target the charmer with harmful abilities or magical effects. The charmer has advantage on any ability check to interact socially with the creature. (Not mechanically enforced -- no "can't target a specific creature" mechanism exists.)
